# Status bar with success and info notifications in the gap
size 80 25
list main
dir src 2024-01-02T03:04:00
file README.md 1234 2024-02-03T14:30:00
endlist
layout 3pane
statusbar "C:\fixture" 0 2 list main
notify success "Saved"
statusbar "C:\fixture" 0 2 list main
notify info "Not yet ported"
statusbar "C:\fixture" 0 2 list main
flush
